# bin/darwin/rightkit-swap and its rightkit-swap.sha256 are committed: the Developer-ID-signed helper is built and signed once on
# the Mac and checked in, so every host packs the gate package from git with no Rust build or signing (swap-helper-bundle.mjs).
# A signing receipt written by an older local publish is never committed.
bin/darwin/rightkit-swap.sign.json
